Output assets/vhs/render.mp4

Source assets/vhs/term.tape

Set TypingSpeed 30ms

Type "python3 main.py --render '❤ ❌ 🤖'"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "python3 main.py --render '❤ ❌ 🤖' --ascii"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "python3 main.py --render '🛝' >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo "OK" || echo "MISSING""
Enter
Sleep 2s

